`sector_words_card_multinomial`, `sector_gram` of
[OccupancyWordSectors](../../../D5/S3/Quantum/Entanglement/OccupancyWordSectors.lean)
and its [Scribe](../../../Blueprint/D5/S3/Quantum/Entanglement/OccupancyWordSectors.scribe.cs)
